  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "1: Turn on the personal mirror.\n\n2: Open the full settings menu.\n\n3: Go to the \"Mirrors\" section and enable the \"grabbable\" option toggle.\n\n4: Enable the \"Personal Mirror\" toggle while trying to face a place where the menu isn't in front of you. (A larger mirror size makes this easier. If you can see it, you're fine.)\n\n5: Try to move the mirror.\n\nYou will notice that this will move the menu instead, and it moves in weird ways as well. I managed to get the menu to go really far away from me with this.",
